{
  "version": "Notebook/1.0",
  "items": [
    {
      "type": 1,
      "content": {
        "json": "## Censys Supplier Risk Intelligence\nSupplier risk built from the Censys risk-events feed. Risk instances are rebuilt from their latest event, so the risk panels show the *current* state of each risk regardless of the Time Range. **Status**, **Severity**, **Supplier** and **Risk Category** apply to the risk panels. **Time Range**, **Severity**, **Supplier** and **Risk Category** apply to the **New vs. Resolved Risks** chart and its details. The Status filter does not apply to the chart, because the chart counts opened and resolved events."
      },
      "name": "0a3c227f-21b3-55b9-b3d4-6c6d84922765"
    },
